        "abstract": "The paper presents a new approach to the modelling, simulation and controller design of a complete induction motor electric drive system. The novel technique uses a hardware description language (VHDL) as a unique EDA environment for the system modelling, evaluation and controller design. Simulation results are presented, proving the validity of the model for the vector controlled induction motor system. The advantages of the VHDL approach for a complete drive modelling and control strategy implementation are underlined.",
